Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 21:24:41 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Return 0 for MIN/MAX over ranges with no numeric cells

Whole-column / open-ended ranges (=MAX(A:A)) skip their blank cells, so a
range with no numeric cells now yields nothing to the aggregator. minFunc
seeds Infinity and maxFunc seeds -Infinity with no empty-iteration guard,
so =MAX(A:A) over an empty or all-text column leaked the accumulator
(rendered as #NUM!) instead of Google Sheets' 0. Guard the seed on empty
iteration. Flagged by the agent-review-correctness panel on #521.
